WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:07.768
"Wow," Oliver said.

2
00:00:07.769 --> 00:00:13.578
"I see a lot of trucks!"

3
00:00:13.579 --> 00:00:17.374
The Carters were at a food truck festival.

4
00:00:17.375 --> 00:00:23.408
Each truck sold a different type of food.

5
00:00:23.409 --> 00:00:28.104
"Where should we get dinner?" Mom said.

6
00:00:28.105 --> 00:00:32.483
"At the Taco Time truck," Emmy said.

7
00:00:32.484 --> 00:00:37.091
"At Peppy's Pizza," Harry said.

8
00:00:37.092 --> 00:00:41.623
"I don't want pizza or tacos," Oliver said.

9
00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:46.187
"I want a cupcake from Cupcake King!"

10
00:00:46.188 --> 00:00:49.564
"No, Oliver," Mom said.

11
00:00:49.565 --> 00:00:54.824
"A cupcake is not a dinner."

12
00:00:54.825 --> 00:00:58.427
Dad gave Harry and Emmy money.

13
00:00:58.428 --> 00:01:04.472
"You two can get tacos and pizza," he said.

14
00:01:04.473 --> 00:01:08.242
Harry and Emmy each got on a line.

15
00:01:08.243 --> 00:01:12.588
Dad and Mom took Oliver for a hot dog.

16
00:01:12.589 --> 00:01:15.522
The lines were very long.

17
00:01:15.523 --> 00:01:18.882
Everyone waited and waited.

18
00:01:18.883 --> 00:01:23.833
"This is taking forever," Harry thought.

19
00:01:23.834 --> 00:01:28.454
"I'm starving!" Emmy thought.

20
00:01:28.455 --> 00:01:31.829
Dad groaned.

21
00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:34.667
"We'll be waiting for dinner all night."

22
00:01:34.668 --> 00:01:37.428
More time passed.

23
00:01:37.429 --> 00:01:45.464
"Cupcake King doesn't have a line," Oliver said.

24
00:01:45.465 --> 00:01:47.846
Dad looked at Mom.

25
00:01:47.847 --> 00:01:52.478
"Okay." Mom shrugged. "Let's get cupcakes.

26
00:01:52.479 --> 00:01:56.301
Then we'll get dinner."

27
00:01:56.302 --> 00:02:03.810
Mom waved Harry and Emmy over.

28
00:02:03.811 --> 00:02:08.276
Everyone got cupcakes.

29
00:02:08.277 --> 00:02:12.434
"Yum!" Oliver said.

30
00:02:12.435 --> 00:02:17.372
"These are the best cupcakes ever!" Emmy said.

31
00:02:17.373 --> 00:02:21.683
"Let's get more," Mom said.

32
00:02:21.684 --> 00:02:25.876
Everyone got another cupcake.

33
00:02:25.877 --> 00:02:30.607
"The other trucks have short lines now," Dad said.

34
00:02:30.608 --> 00:02:33.693
"Should we get dinner?"

35
00:02:33.694 --> 00:02:37.195
"I can't eat dinner," Mom said.

36
00:02:37.196 --> 00:02:42.142
"I ate too many cupcakes!"

